Subject: [PATCH 1884/3799] soh: rename func_80B8EE24 -> ObjBean_GrowPlant

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: advances the two growth angles toward their limits and drives the plant's scale from their sines, easing the sway offset back to centre.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c
index c38403df9..a1d03e4e3 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c
@@ -200,7 +200,8 @@ void ObjBean_HidePlant(ObjBean* this) {
     Actor_SetScale(&this->dyna.actor, 0.0f);
 }
 
-void func_80B8EE24(ObjBean* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B8EE24: advances the two growth angles toward their limits and drives the plant's scale from their sines, easing the sway offset back to centre.
+void ObjBean_GrowPlant(ObjBean* this) {
     this->unk_1B6.x += 0x384;
     if (this->unk_1B6.x > 0x5FFF) {
         this->unk_1B6.x = 0x5FFF;
@@ -862,7 +863,7 @@ void func_80B909F8(ObjBean* this) {
 void func_80B90A34(ObjBean* this, PlayState* play) {
     s32 trampled = ObjBean_CheckForHorseTrample(this, play);
 
-    func_80B8EE24(this);
+    ObjBean_GrowPlant(this);  // was func_80B8EE24 [LLM:HIGH]
     if (trampled) {
         DynaPoly_EnableCollision(play, &play->colCtx.dyna, this->dyna.bgId);
     } else {
